      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">The widest mainstream ergonomic chair for tall users is the Steelcase Leap Plus (~21" seat width, 22.5" seat height, 19.75" adjustable seat depth). The La-Z-Boy Trafford Big and Tall (~22" seat width) is wider, but its fixed seat depth and 21" seat height ceiling limit it to users 6'0"–6'2". For tall, broad-shouldered users, the Leap Plus is the only option that covers width, height, and adjustable depth simultaneously.</p>
