        <p>The Trafford's ~22" seat width is the widest in this comparison. For users at 6'0"–6'2" who have an unusually wide frame and are on a budget, it is the practical choice. The 400 lb weight capacity handles larger builds. The main limitations — fixed ~19" seat depth, foam seat construction, and ~21" seat height ceiling — constrain it to users below about 6'2" with average or shorter proportions.</p>

